                                                "sense_id": "0bb02973-351f-3710-8270-6f643de44c7f",
                                                "text": "Former Vice President Joe Biden's lead in the race for the Democratic nomination for president has rebounded, and now stands at its widest margin since April, according to a new CNN poll conducted by SSRS."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dedd9942-efac-3e29-9f17-7d93e8a36d77",
                                        "entry_id": "39a5a13b-af6e-3a7b-85f1-9f36ef86da5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Large in scope."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca110a5f-cd08-4c7c-b49e-6ae9ec09171b",
                                                "sense_id": "dedd9942-efac-3e29-9f17-7d93e8a36d77",
                                                "text": "The inquiry had a wide remit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ef83cc6-ecbf-4d93-8de5-adb9c08526b5",
                                                "sense_id": "dedd9942-efac-3e29-9f17-7d93e8a36d77",
                                                "text": "The single-imaging optic of the mammalian eye offers some distinct visual advantages. Such lenses can take in photons from a wide range of angles, increasing light sensitivity. They also have high spatial resolution, resolving incoming images in minute detail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e036072-4137-4ffa-8c8b-c27191210c6c",
                                                "sense_id": "dedd9942-efac-3e29-9f17-7d93e8a36d77",
                                                "text": "Three-way girls offered the widest array of services. One twenty-two-year-old prostitute declared to an undercover vice investigator in New York City, \"I am a three-way girl.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ffdf4e4-2515-442c-bdc1-731ac9ba28ff",
                                                "sense_id": "dedd9942-efac-3e29-9f17-7d93e8a36d77",
                                                "text": "Lizzo, who is known for messages of self-love and wider acceptance, has recently said as much as she shared that she is encouraging a stance of body neutrality for herself and others."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88a207ec-cf98-3809-9dda-0fd9203cb1fe",
                                        "entry_id": "39a5a13b-af6e-3a7b-85f1-9f36ef86da5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Overweight, obese."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "humorous",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2afc901-51f1-30e6-9684-3ccea29ad7e5",
                                        "entry_id": "39a5a13b-af6e-3a7b-85f1-9f36ef86da5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Operating at the side of the playing area."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e12af631-0d73-4691-a993-1039f7a867fd",
                                                "sense_id": "f2afc901-51f1-30e6-9684-3ccea29ad7e5",
                                                "text": "That team needs a decent wide player."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa967277-9438-3d00-b9fc-ab36273e084c",
                                        "entry_id": "39a5a13b-af6e-3a7b-85f1-9f36ef86da5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On one side or the other of the mark; too far sideways from the mark, the wicket, the batsman, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42f85044-5d1b-4f25-a3b6-addf8cff052d",
                                                "sense_id": "fa967277-9438-3d00-b9fc-ab36273e084c",
                                                "text": "Two balls before lunch, he bowled a wide."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8903f84-baba-4b66-a1a0-231b286cc342",
                                                "sense_id": "fa967277-9438-3d00-b9fc-ab36273e084c",
                                                "text": "Too bad! That was a great passing-shot, but it's wide."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48670fa5-ae34-40d8-8237-88c60876d62b",
                                                "sense_id": "fa967277-9438-3d00-b9fc-ab36273e084c",
                                                "text": "Surely he shoots wide on the Bow-Hand."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2a72003-60f7-422d-a4ae-f8aaf9080644",
                                                "sense_id": "fa967277-9438-3d00-b9fc-ab36273e084c",
                                                "text": "I was but two bows wide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f054988-0349-3e04-b2cc-2543a7481d5c",
                                        "entry_id": "39a5a13b-af6e-3a7b-85f1-9f36ef86da5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Made, as a vowel, with a less tense, and more open and relaxed, condition of the organs in the mouth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "651b6a9f-cb23-3998-863d-e963331f0cde",
                                        "entry_id": "39a5a13b-af6e-3a7b-85f1-9f36ef86da5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vast, great in extent, extensive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Northern-England",
                                            "Scotland",
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1357f420-3519-4227-a8a5-d10967ae2df9",
                                                "sense_id": "651b6a9f-cb23-3998-863d-e963331f0cde",
                                                "text": "The wide, lifeless expanse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0c794ac-8180-3ca6-b34b-6545242bc7ee",
                                        "entry_id": "39a5a13b-af6e-3a7b-85f1-9f36ef86da5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Located some distance away; distant, far."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0d4a3bb-1081-4bcb-abf3-e2696bab6e96",
                                                "sense_id": "e0c794ac-8180-3ca6-b34b-6545242bc7ee",
                                                "text": "Mr Hunt's house, you know, lies wide from Harlowe-place."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce703ae7-6a4a-4625-8c42-aaaa26cf8802",
                                                "sense_id": "e0c794ac-8180-3ca6-b34b-6545242bc7ee",
                                                "text": "the contrary [being] so wide from the truth of Scripture and the attributes of God"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15ed3c9f-d128-332f-ade5-9f844c93acc4",
                                        "entry_id": "39a5a13b-af6e-3a7b-85f1-9f36ef86da5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Far from truth, propriety, necessity, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f391c6c-c8c8-42eb-b992-8f258222ac41",
                                                "sense_id": "15ed3c9f-d128-332f-ade5-9f844c93acc4",
                                                "text": "And I trust anon by the help of an infallible guide, to perfect such Prutenic tables, as shall mend the astronomy of our wide expositors."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f53cd8e-6919-4b4b-8c4f-589feaa14ed3",
                                                "sense_id": "15ed3c9f-d128-332f-ade5-9f844c93acc4",
                                                "text": "But I tell you, it is farre wyde, that the people haue ſuche iudgmentes, the Byſhoppes they coulde laughe at it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21c57f0c-c1ef-4619-99e9-7dfd6619b670",
                                                "sense_id": "15ed3c9f-d128-332f-ade5-9f844c93acc4",
                                                "text": "How wide is all this long pretence!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a9ce2aa-4f9c-395a-bb35-a1f4ecffb003",
                                        "entry_id": "39a5a13b-af6e-3a7b-85f1-9f36ef86da5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or supporting a greater range of text characters than can fit into the traditional 8-bit representation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6680500d-bb41-460f-ade6-48b5d06f0667",
                                                "sense_id": "6a9ce2aa-4f9c-395a-bb35-a1f4ecffb003",
                                                "text": "a wide character; a wide stream"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fdf64135-d4ca-3b4a-aab4-70d5483b6076",
                                        "entry_id": "39a5a13b-af6e-3a7b-85f1-9f36ef86da5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sharp-witted."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce7636be-267f-40fe-9b9c-c8d239aceecc",
                                                "sense_id": "fdf64135-d4ca-3b4a-aab4-70d5483b6076",
                                                "text": "But the first visitor to penetrate from the outside world proved to be Sergeant Williams; large and pink and scrubbed-looking; and for a little while Grant forgot about battles long ago and considered wide boys alive today."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
